menu "SIGSEV: easter egg"

    config SIGSEV_EASTER_EGG
        bool "Konami code: the kiwi dances \"6 7\", explodes and reboots the whole mesh"
        default y
        help
            Up Up Down Down Left Right Left Right KEY2 KEY2 on the board (or
            tools/konami.py over USB) plays the animation, and when the kiwi
            explodes every other board plays it too and then they all reboot.

            Any board can reboot the whole network with this: turn it off for
            real use. With it off the board ignores the packet (it still
            forwards it, like any other).

endmenu
